{
  "schema": 1,
  "updated": "2026-11-11",
  "note": "单一事实源：平台支持范围、实测版本、已知坑。人读视图由 dia doctor 派生，不要手抄进 md。",
  "platforms": {
    "opencode": {
      "supported": true,
      "render": "~/.config/opencode/agents/<id>.md",
      "probe": [
        "--version"
      ],
      "range": ">=2.2.0 <2.3.0",
      "tested": [
        "2.2.5",
        "2.2.6"
      ],
      "tested_note": "口径（2026-11-11 用户定）：固定最近 minor 2.2.*；升 2.3 时先升两台机器再改这里",
      "notes": [
        "V1 → V2 断代：V1 实现不在 V2 运行，配置键与 hook API 全变",
        "配置文件 opencode.json / opencode.jsonc 二选一；两者都在时宿主先读 .json"
      ]
    },
    "dsh": {
      "supported": true,
      "render": "~/.dsh/profiles/<id>/",
      "probe": [
        "--version"
      ],
      "range": ">=0.2.0 <0.3.0",
      "tested": [
        "0.2.1-rc.2"
      ],
      "notes": [
        "preset 里 patch 覆写 preset 会让全部 agent 掉工具，需冷启动",
        "cordis.yml 由宿主运行时重写；改动写 cordis.patch.yml",
        "覆盖插件 config 是整体替换，必填项要一起写"
      ]
    },
    "codex": {
      "supported": false,
      "render": null,
      "probe": [
        "--version"
      ],
      "range": null,
      "tested": [],
      "notes": [
        "只有配置注入实践（~/.codex/config.toml），未纳入 dia 渲染"
      ]
    },
    "mimocode": {
      "supported": false,
      "render": null,
      "probe": [
        "--version"
      ],
      "range": null,
      "tested": [],
      "notes": [
        "只有配置注入实践，未纳入 dia 渲染"
      ]
    },
    "zed": {
      "supported": false,
      "render": null,
      "probe": [
        "--version"
      ],
      "range": null,
      "tested": [],
      "notes": [
        "只有配置注入实践（language_models.openai_compatible），未纳入 dia 渲染"
      ]
    }
  }
}
